@page "/components/skeleton"

<PageTitle>Skeleton — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Skeleton</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    Worth knowing where this belongs before using it: on static SSR the server finishes rendering
    before a byte reaches the browser, so a skeleton the server draws is one nobody ever sees. It
    is for <code>[up-placeholder]</code> — the fragment Unpoly shows while a swap is in flight —
    which means it lives in a <code>&lt;template&gt;</code> in the layout, not in the page it
    stands in for.
</p>

